{"id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","title":"Riemannian Manifold","display":"df-riemannian-manifold — Riemannian Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","aliases":["58-df-riemannian-manifold","Riemannian Manifold"],"display":"df-riemannian-manifold — Riemannian Manifold","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-riemannian-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-riemannian-manifold</span><span>Riemannian Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-riemannian-manifold — Riemannian Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e548027ea9dbef59\" href=\"?note=e548027ea9dbef59\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md\">../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^n\">\\(M^n\\)</span> (smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\Gamma^\\infty(\\operatorname{Sym}^2T^*M)\">\\(g\\in\\Gamma^\\infty(\\operatorname{Sym}^2T^*M)\\)</span> (smooth symmetric covariant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>-tensor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{T_pM\\times T_pM}\">\\(g_p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{T_pM\\times T_pM}\\)</span> (inner product on tangent space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\)</span> (Riemannian metric-tensor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e548027ea9dbef59\" href=\"?note=e548027ea9dbef59\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md\">../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> (Riemannian-manifold predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Riemannian manifold: smooth manifold with inner product on each tangent space</li>\n<li>Metric: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> defines length, angle, volume; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v,w \\rangle_g = g(v,w)\">\\(\\langle v,w \\rangle_g = g(v,w)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Levi-Civita: unique connection preserving metric; Christoffel symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^i_{jk}\">\\(\\Gamma^i_{jk}\\)</span></li>\n<li>A geodesic is defined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\dot\\gamma}\\dot\\gamma=0\">\\(\\nabla_{\\dot\\gamma}\\dot\\gamma=0\\)</span> for the Levi--Civita connection; uniqueness of that connection is a theorem.</li>\n<li>Hopf--Rinow equates metric completeness, geodesic completeness, and compactness of closed bounded subsets for connected Riemannian manifolds.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>do Carmo, Riemannian Geometry</li>\n<li>Lee, Riemannian Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"e548027ea9dbef59","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"e548027ea9dbef59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)$ (Riemannian metric-tensor predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\Gamma^\\infty(\\operatorname{Sym}^2T^*M)","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"g_p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{T_pM\\times T_pM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle v,w \\rangle_g = g(v,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^i_{jk}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\dot\\gamma}\\dot\\gamma=0","display":false}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6d7cb9d5ebdb5c","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S$ (Riemannian-manifold predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]])"},{"id":"84333fc892f1be29","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad55d3b2dfeece56","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c7d1de20e312049","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e06256d3696011c6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85ef85f035e9b2d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56f078003b4a5a13","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"afa5f963c264afee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1e779ca93eb771b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3db83908de2fd3e1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ and $\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])"},{"id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])"},{"id":"ad8ab2e9124a5a20","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a56264a662b79511","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])"},{"id":"34aba96812e204dc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)$ and $\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-manifold]] and [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])."},{"id":"c68be82f52a64de5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)$ (see [[58-df-riem